     "value": 17
    }
   },
   "literals": [],
   "notes": [
    {
     "figures": {},
     "kind": "estimate",
     "literals": [],
     "text": "So a reserve replaces the cushion in the budget rather than adding to it, if the budget is set lower once the reserve exists (our reading)."
    }
   ],
   "rests_on": [
    "b-under",
    "b-cush"
   ],
   "so": {
    "figures": {},
    "literals": [],
    "text": "A reserve saves money only if the budget is set lower once it exists: that is the decision to watch."
   },
   "text": "The cushion is already there: the three lines spent under budget in 11 of 17 years."
  }
